 "remarks": "Discover elevated city living at 1911 Summer Street, an exclusive collection of brand-new luxury townhomes thoughtfully designed to combine modern elegance, refined comfort, and exceptional convenience.  Each beautifully appointed residence offers 3 spacious bedrooms and 3 full bathrooms, complemented by an open and inviting layout ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. Contemporary design, high-quality finishes, and carefully selected details create a sophisticated atmosphere throughout. An attached one-car garage provides added privacy, security, and convenience.  Perfectly positioned in one of Stamford's most desirable and accessible locations, these exceptional townhomes place you moments from vibrant downtown dining, upscale shopping, entertainment, parks, transportation, and major commuter routes.  Experience the perfect balance of luxury, space, and urban convenience at 1911 Summer Street-where contemporary design meets an exceptional Stamford lifestyle.",
